  "content": "Corporate income taxes\u2014Net corporate income tax receipts were $160.8 billion for the third quarter of Fiscal Year 2021. This is an increase of $152.9 billion compared to the prior year third quarter. This change is due to an increase in estimated and final payments; there was not a significant change in corporate refunds.",
