  "content": "<table><tr><th colspan=\"4\">Third-Quarter Net Budget Receipts by Source, Fiscal Year 2021</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"4\">[In billions of dollars. Source: \"Monthly Treasury Statement of Receipts and Outlays of the United States Government\"]</td></tr><tr><th>Source</th><th>April</th><th>May</th><th>June</th></tr><tr><td>Individual income taxes</td><td>194.7</td><td>306.5</td><td>264.8</td></tr><tr><td>Corporate income taxes</td><td>72.8</td><td>13.8</td><td>74.2</td></tr><tr><td>Employment and general retirement</td><td>133.4</td><td>102.7</td><td>78.0</td></tr><tr><td>Unemployment insurance</td><td>10.0</td><td>12.5</td><td>1.4</td></tr><tr><td>Contributions for other insurance and retirement</td><td>0.5</td><td>0.4</td><td>0.5</td></tr><tr><td>Excise taxes</td><td>5.9</td><td>6.9</td><td>7.1</td></tr><tr><td>Estate and gift taxes</td><td>4.6</td><td>3.0</td><td>2.4</td></tr><tr><td>Customs duties</td><td>7.1</td><td>6.4</td><td>7.2</td></tr><tr><td>Miscellaneous receipts</td><td>10.2</td><td>11.5</td><td>13.7</td></tr><tr><td>Total budget receipts</td><td>439.2</td><td>463.7</td><td>449.2</td></tr></table>",
