  "content": "Corporate income taxes\u2014Net corporate income tax receipts were $106.7 billion for the fourth quarter of Fiscal Year 2021. This is a decrease of $13.1 billion compared to the prior year fourth quarter. The $13.1 billion change is comprised of a decrease of $22.4 billion in estimated and final payments, and a decrease of $9.4 billion in corporate refunds.",
